    "source": "nss-layout",
    "slug": "nss-layout",
    "message": "mac80211: match the selected NSS 12.5 statistics layout\n\nThe NSS driver enables NSS_FIRMWARE_VERSION_12_5 while mac80211 omits it,\nso the consumer reads peer statistics with a shorter stride. Pass the\ndefine for selected 12.5 ath11k NSS builds and track the firmware\nselectors as rebuild dependencies. Preserve 11.4 and disabled-NSS paths;\nbump the package release.\n\nSigned-off-by: Yuen Su <zypulsecore@gmail.com>\n",
